 class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">AUDIOBOOK REVIEW : 3.5⭐️<br /><br />I’m disappointed 😭<br /><br />I didn’t particularly like Ahnna before and unfortunately I still don’t. She was pretty naive and immature in this book especially with Aren which is a very reasonable person🧍🏻‍♀️ and I still don’t like her behaviour with Lara<br /><br />The story was also a bit disappointing it’s full of court intrigues and gossips and not at all as action-packed as the last books. The most fun I had was in the first chapters.<br /><br />I was hoping for James to make me love Ahnna but he was kind of a coward. I expect his character will also evolve in the next book otherwise he really sucks.<br /><br />I’m disappointed in the forbidden love trope I was expecting more from it, there was only Georgie being annoyed and that’s it, not enough tension, not enough longing 🥲<br /><br />I’m really sad because I LOVED the first 4 books and I’ll be so disappointed if the last book in the series is not up to the 5 ⭐️ standard 😭<br /><br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">16 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelI