she was told to do by everyone.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd fuck that ending. Another thing that she could have prevented by not trusting the queen like EVERYONE warned her, but I guess she knows better.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd now James is completely off his rocker because he thinks the woman who would do anything to PROTECT her people would assassinate a pair of allied monarchs that would surly bring war to her people.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e😤😤😤😤😤😤\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI'm getting real tired of this trope where a character says they're deeply in love with someone but then just completely 180s on that person with no effort to look at what makes sense or why. I obviously understand this situation was highly emotional, but if your woman can be framed and you believe it that easily, then it's not meant to be.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd this bonus scene with Bronwyn at the end where James just goes crazy on them too? BOOOOOOOO\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut I will obviously continue because I need to know what happens but I'm pretty disappointed with this one 😭","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WN9T6UTFJW32\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF\"}}"},"likeCount":82,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":15},"User:68036870":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":68036870,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1751132393i/68036870._UX200_CR0,24,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":90,"textReviewsCount":304,"name":"Aya ☕︎","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/68036870-aya","contributor":null,"id":68036870},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1JH91QW7H4ISB":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1JH91QW7H4ISB"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1JH91QW7H4ISB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/a