.review:goodreads.v1.wGhMCK71A9x-W9w_TwSLYw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.wGhMCK71A9x-W9w_TwSLYw","creator":{"__ref":"User:56920971"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1785379364697,"createdAt":1735493015312,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1760034024902,"text":"Let me just say: rereading this book felt like slipping into battle armor made of silk and sarcasm. Ahnna, my blade-wielding queen, remains the blueprint for morally gray heroines who could gut you with a glare and still make you swoon. This romantasy masterpiece didn’t just hold up it held me hostage (again), and I’m not even mad about it.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e👑 Ahnna’s arc? Deliciously sharp. She’s not here to play court games she’s here to win them, burn the rulebook, and maybe kiss the wrong prince while she’s at it. Her trauma is real, her choices are brutal, and her loyalty to Ithicana makes me want to tattoo “bride or blade” on my soul.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e💰 Harendell’s court? Think Versailles meets Game of Thrones, but with better outfits and worse trust issues. Every smile is a threat, every alliance a trap, and I ate up every manipulative morsel like it was spiced with betrayal.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e🔥 James? Oh, James. The forbidden hero with a moral compass and a jawline carved by angst. Their chemistry is so potent it could start wars and honestly, I’d volunteer as tribute.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e💔 The stakes? High. The politics? Twisted. The tension? So thick you could slice it with Ahnna’s dagger and still not reach the bottom.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e📚 This reread reminded me why I fell in love with romantasy in the first place: the blend of heartache, heat, and high-stakes heroism. I laughed, I gasped, I highlighted like a maniac. And now I’m pacing like a feral reader waiting for the next book to drop.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e🗡️ Final verdict: If loving this book is wrong, I don’t want to be right. Ahnna didn’t just reclaim her throne she reclaimed my entire TBR. Book 2, I’m coming for you like Ahnna comes for vengeance: beautifully, brutally, and with zero chill.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eaaaaand that cliffhanger my my miss Jensen a round of applause .... \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e 🎶“My Tears Ricochet” Taylor Swift\u003cbr /\u003e 🎶“Sweet but Psycho” Ava Max\u003cbr /\u003e 🎶 “Love is a Battlefield” Pat Benatar\u003cbr /\u003e 🎶“Skinny Love” Bon Iver\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u003cbr /\u003eIt's one of the favorites of the year for sure.... so so good.... the only problem is I don't have the next book to read, and I need it...NOW!! How can I wait to read and see what will happen ....danielle jensen have mercy on me... someone send me an arc... well here I am manifesting it...","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A11XRVY5XSHLZT\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF\"}}"},"likeCount":33,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:174367618":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":174367618,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1737065710i/174367618._UX200_CR0,50,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":103,"textReviewsCount":169,"name":"Zeph rose","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/174367618-zeph-rose","contributor":null,"id":174367618},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3VA4PX815ZJJ8":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3VA4PX815ZJJ8"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3VA4PX815ZJJ8\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.GLsjSe2-wBlLlZjQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3VA4PX815ZJJ8","id":"kca://profile:goodrea