ractions between her and James. Everything with the sharks and escaping the waters was just so well done. \u003cbr /\u003eBut then we get to Harendell and the story slows down. There's a lot of political maneuvering happening but it never caught my attention. Ahnna's choices and attitudes are a bit over the top. I don't understand how someone who knew this was who her betrothed was for years and knew what was expected of women here was unable to understand any customs. Or make any attempts to fit in even a little to the country she thought she could help rule one day. She knows this is a country that thrives on political schemes but trusts so easily that nobody will possible lie or scheme when it comes to her which makes her seem so naïve. \u003cbr /\u003eAhnna decides no matter what she should do the opposite of anything James says. Even when it is to her detriment and he is actually trying to help her. I get that she wants to show how special and independent and not like other girls in Harendell she is but all this does is show her immaturity and inability to reason. There was so much potential between them from the start but it just doesn't get to a point where there is any real communication which is frustrating. \u003cbr /\u003eThere's the inevitable betrayals and splitting up of the love interests to end the book on a sort of cliff hanger. \u003cbr /\u003eWas well narrated and the book is still enjoyable and I will read the next one. But I had higher hopes and expectations for this one. ","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A4HSYFI0703RA\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF\"}}"},"likeCount":18,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:155045692":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":155045692,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1785684971i/155045692._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":674,"textReviewsCount":742,"name":"Maeghan \u0026#x1f98b;","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/155045692-maeghan-x1f98b","contributor":null,"id":155045692},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z28I735P4A0Z":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z28I735P4A0Z"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z28I735P4A0Z\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z28I735P4A0Z","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z28I735P4A0Z"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/155045692?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7730109591"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.3zA2w6mSscLXQkEm3D773A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.3zA2w6mSscLXQkEm3D773A","creator":{"__ref":"User:155045692"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1776585079062,"createdAt":1752271903729,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1776564434495,"text":"« For you to become something else other than who you are would be the greatest tragedy. »\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat an unlikable world. Harendell was truly the worst Kingdom in this series so far. All of the side characters (except Taryn \u0026amp; Bronwyn but they disappeared halfway throughout the book) were absolutely despicable (except Edward).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e« A woman so fierce that even sharks gave way to her. »\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAhnna again couldn’t wrap her head around the fact that she didn’t see Lara coming but she went ahead and trusted every single vipers in this one. 🥲 What truly baffles me is she ruled a Kingdom and was the commandant for a long while and in this one… where was she, really?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e« A woman who would fight until the bitter end, screaming defiance until her last breath. »\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eUgh and I’m disappointed by this but I didn’t like James AT ALL😭!! Danielle gave us Aren and Keris who would set the world on fire for their women and then she gave us… James🫥. I hope he’s not it for our girl but I’m just being delusional. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e« … Like being stuck in a world cast in a thousand shades of gray when all I dream of is color. »\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe bridge kingdom : 5✨\u003cbr /\u003eThe traitor queen : 4✨\u003cbr /\u003eThe inadequate heir : ♾️ ✨ \u003cbr /\u003eThe endless war : 5✨\u003cbr /\u003eThe twisted throne : 3✨","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z28I735P4A0Z\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF\"}}"},"likeCount":18,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":3},"User:60725431":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":60725431,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1678971318i/60725431._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":992,"textReviewsCount":2360,"name":"Booksblabbering || Cait❣️","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/60725431-booksblabbering-cait","contributor":null,"id":60725431},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A25RBXQE0APV1R":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A25RBXQE0APV1R"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25RBXQE0APV1R\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A25RBXQE0APV1R","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A25RBXQE0APV1R"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/60725431?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"kindle-unlimited","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/60725431?shelf=kindle-unlimited"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"indie","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/60725431?shelf=indie"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8004437119"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.PzpHB87uhc2PQG5CBhqRRQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.PzpHB87uhc2PQG5CBhqRRQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:60725431"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1776849283147,"createdAt":1761068442200,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1761068535924,"text":"I forgot how addictive this series is. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDanielle L Jensen pulls off arranged marriage so well. I swear most of her books have one. \u003cbr /\u003eThe wealthy kingdom of Harendell claims her as a bride for its crown prince, Ahnna is prepared to do whatever it takes to gain influence as the future queen. Of course, she ends up falling for her betrothed’s half-brother. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI didn’t really remember who Ahnna was, but the start of the book reminded me of the switch up in A Court of Silver Flames by SjM regarding Feyre and Nesta and in this one, Ahnna’s take on Lara. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe romance is very obvious, but it is more slow-burn as it’s forbidden and both have a lot to balance and lose. \u003cbr /\u003eHonestly, it felt slow and then very sudden. They acted like buddies with (not very hidden) longing and they barely exchange any intimate moments before BAM - ill-timed sex scene. That seems to be common for her books. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOf course, there’s some great political intrigue which I always enjoy in a romantasy. We also get small povs rarely from the titular characters of the previous two duologies. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI wouldn’t recommend reading this as a standalone duology as there are too many connections and pre-existing lore you need to know. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI would definitely recommend the audio as this is dialogue-heavy and the narrators do a brilliant job and there are even side effects. \u003cbr /\u003eThree stars story, four stars for the fun audiobook.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/booksblabbering/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBookstagram\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@booksblabbering\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eTiktok\u003c/a\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25RBXQE0APV1R\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0vLaeuJQJc6PKxeF\"}}"},"likeCount":16,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:98110210":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":98110210,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1642005695i/98110210._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3,"textReviewsCount":104,"name":"Kourtney Zacharias","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/98110210-kourtney-zacharias","contributor":null,"id":98110210},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2JSUI7H0SK6X9":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JSUI7H0SK6X9"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._WimmOrIBYykGQJ7":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._WimmOrIBYykGQJ7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JSUI7H0SK6X9\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._WimmOrIBYykGQJ7\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2JSUI7H0SK6X9","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JSUI7H0SK6X9"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._WimmOrIBYykGQJ7","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._WimmOrIBYykGQJ7"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98110210?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7658044148"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.d0aGlY6-JgiH-4yCqa9N8Q":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.d0aGlY6-JgiH-4yCqa9N8Q","creator":{"__ref":"User:98110210"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1783697552371,"createdAt":1751483991639,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1751490253381,"text":"Alright. The female leads get worse with each book. Lara? 10/10. Smart. Rational. Loving. Passionate. Zarrah? 7/10. Liked her enough. Ahnna suuuucks. She's your typical \"I hate dresses, I'm a WARRIOR\" pick-me. Her worst trauma is the over looked twin? Idk, pretty boring. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMost of the side characters are unlikable. Georgie, William, Virginia are all horrible. Taryn and Bronwyn are annoying and there was no point in them being there. Felt like the bonus chapter was added ~only~ for some *representation*. Flush out those scenes for the characters if you want it to actually matter. Elizabeth? Horrible. Eddie? Also annoying. AT LEAST Alexandra had some depth but it's sad and frustrating that Lestara is one of the most likable characters in the book! LESTARA! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJames is likable. Typical secret keeping/miscommunication trope that at this point, I'm getting sick of. Idk why Danielle wrote the perfect happy ending, standalone type book to blow it all to shit in the end. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis was by far the worst of the 5. I'll finish the series (unfortunately), but at this point I only care if Lara and Keris live. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBased off how the series is going, I genuinely wouldn't recommend starting it based on how frustrating everyone but Lara is. Or just read books 1 \u0026amp; 2 and leave it at that.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e(As I add to my review I get more upset and hate this book even more. BOOOOOO)","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JSUI7H0SK6X9\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._WimmOrIBYykGQJ7\"}}"},"likeCount":16,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:158093592":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":158093592,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1741770545i/158093592._UY200_CR60,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":11,"textReviewsCount":220,"name":"Rani","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/158093592-rani","contributor":null,"id":158093592},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2OF21JZIO47BG":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2OF21JZIO47BG"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2OF21JZIO47BG\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._2BOZUEOSPznMBD7\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2OF21JZIO47BG","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2OF21JZIO47BG"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._2BOZUEOSPznMBD7","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._2BOZUEOSPznMBD7"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/158093592?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6660858839"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.j4jaH_vWh67bBmfzLI1Qjw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.j4jaH_vWh67bBmfzLI1Qjw","creator":{"__ref":"User:158093592"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1784935706683,"createdAt":1737633191906,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1737633523251,"text":"AUDIOBOOK REVIEW : 3.5⭐️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI’m disappointed 😭\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI didn’t particularly like Ahnna before and unfortunately I still don’t. She was pretty naive and immature in this book especially with Aren which is a very reasonable person🧍🏻‍♀️ and I still don’t like her behaviour with Lara\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe story was also a bit disappointing it’s full of court intrigues and gossips and not at all as action-packed as the last books. The most fun I had was in the first chapters.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was hoping for James to make me love Ahnna but he was kind of a coward. I expect his character will also evolve in the next book otherwise he really sucks.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI’m disappointed in the forbidden love trope I was expecting more from it, there was only Georgie being annoyed and that’s it, not enough tension, not enough longing 🥲\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI’m really sad because I LOVED the first 4 books and I’ll be so disappointed if the last book in the series is not up to the 5 ⭐️ standard 😭\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2OF21JZIO47BG\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3._2BOZUEOSPznMBD7\"}}"},"likeCount":16,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:137527928":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":137527928,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1728325392i/137527928._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":174,"textReviewsCount":341,"name":"Isabelle","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/137527928-isabelle","contributor":null,"id":137527928},"User